values ('bbbb0003-0000-4000-8000-000000000019', 'en', null, 'Leadership & Team Management', 'How to lead people rather than just manage tasks — self-awareness, motivation, team dynamics, communication, feedback, conflict, and change, built into a practical toolkit for new and aspiring managers. Structure adapted from OpenStax Organizational Behavior and Principles of Management (CC BY 4.0).', null, 'career', 25, true, 'business', '{bbbb0003-0000-4000-8000-000000000005}')
on conflict (id) do nothing;

